inal year of primary school? What if they are more or less than what you expected?<br /> <br /> Features<br /> [Student] You play as a student of 13 or 14 years of age in your final year at the academy. And you have already taken your second Breath into the world of Exalted. At Present, only the Water Aspect Dragon blood has not been chosen yet.<br /> [The Realm] You plays as scions of the realm, members of the dragon blooded houses that rule the larges Empire on the face of Creation.<br /> [School] The main setting of the game takes place at school and within the Imperial city of the Realm. Her Scarlet Grace, as the school is known and called.<br /> [Activities] Games, Homework, Relationship, and the like are all part of school life, and will be explored throughout your final year in school.<br /> [Death] Death is a theme of the game, and what happens when it occurs with children.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>How can I know if what I claim I know to be true is rejecting the idea that there is something I might not know? How can I know if what I claim I don't know to be true is rejecting the idea that there is something I do know?<br /> -Zhuangzi","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1715-ostarion","name":"Ostarion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1715_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"305"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T04:00:07-07:00","id":1220496,"title":"","content":"I apologize, the empty spot quickly filled up and so I can't take anymore requests at this time, sorry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>How can I know if what I claim I know to be true is rejecting the idea that there is something I might not know? How can I know if what I claim I don't know to be true is rejecting the idea that 